---
---

<section class="home-hero site-pad">
	<div class="home-hero__copy">
		<p class="home-hero__eyebrow">
			<span class="home-hero__dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
			<span>Runtime v0.1 — built on pi coding-agent SDK</span>
		</p>
		<h1 class="home-hero__title">
			<span>Assemble your agents.</span>
			<span>Run them as one.</span>
		</h1>
		<p class="home-hero__body">
			Rune is a multi-profile agent runtime. Define specialized agents as profiles — system
			prompt, model, skills, tools — wire them into graphs, and run the whole thing through
			a single engine.
		</p>
		<div class="home-hero__actions">
			<a class="btn-primary btn-primary--lg" href="#quickstart">Get started →</a>
			<a
				class="btn-secondary btn-secondary--lg"
				href="https://github.com/SquidCorp/rune"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a
			>
		</div>
	</div>
	<img
		class="home-hero__art"
		src="/snake-no-bg.png"
		alt=""
		width="320"
		height="320"
		decoding="async"
	/>
</section>

<style lang="scss">
	.home-hero {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: var(--spacing-8);
		padding-top: var(--spacing-24);
		padding-bottom: var(--spacing-16);

		&__copy {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: var(--spacing-8);
			max-width: 720px;
			min-width: 0;
		}

		&__eyebrow {
			display: inline-flex;
			align-items: center;
			gap: var(--spacing-3);
			margin: 0;
			font-family: var(--font-mono), ui-monospace, monospace;
			font-size: var(--text-xs);
			font-weight: var(--font-weight-medium);
			letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wider);
			line-height: var(--leading-label);
			text-transform: uppercase;
			color: var(--color-muted);
		}

		&__dot {
			width: 6px;
			height: 6px;
			border-radius: var(--radius-full);
			background: var(--color-accent);
			box-shadow: #7b5cfacc 0 0 8px 1px;
			flex-shrink: 0;
		}

		&__title {
			display: flex;
			flex-direction: column;
			margin: 0;
			font-family: var(--font-display), ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
			font-size: var(--text-5xl);
			font-weight: var(--font-weight-semibold);
			letter-spacing: var(--tracking-tight);
			line-height: var(--leading-display);
			color: var(--color-ink);
		}

		&__body {
			margin: 0;
			max-width: 560px;
			font-family: var(--font-body), ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
			font-size: var(--text-md);
			line-height: var(--leading-body);
			color: var(--color-ink-dim);
		}

		&__actions {
			display: flex;
			flex-wrap: wrap;
			align-items: center;
			gap: var(--spacing-4);
		}

		&__art {
			width: 320px;
			height: 320px;
			object-fit: contain;
			flex-shrink: 0;

			@media (max-width: 900px) {
				display: none;
			}
		}
	}
</style>
